"<code>country</code> attribute nor "
"<code>source=\"viewer_origin\"</code>/<code>source=\"viewer_current\"</code>"
" is used (e.g. \"Built by South Africans, for South Africans\"). Edit "
"demonyms on the <a href=\"%s\">Countries</a> screen."
