"The fallback for [rbn_demonym source=\"viewer_current\"] / [rbn_country "
"source=\"viewer_current\"] - shown to a logged-out visitor, or a member who "
"hasn't set \"Country You Currently Live In\" on their profile. Once a member"
" sets that field, they see their own country instead."
